# R8 rules for the release build, on top of AGP's defaults and the rules libraries ship. Only what those leave out goes here.
#
# Covered by the libraries' own rules, so nothing here:
# - kotlinx.serialization keeps each @Serializable class's Companion.serializer() and INSTANCE. Lexicon models are serialized only through
#   AtJson with generated or hand-written serializers, and `$type` is an ordinary @SerialName property, so no class-name polymorphism.
#   Circuit screens' serial names are compile-time strings registered through Metro (CircuitBindings.kt).
# - Room 3 builds AppDatabase through @ConstructedBy, with no reflection; Metro graphs and Metro-generated Circuit factories are plain code.

# cryptography-kotlin: CryptographyProvider.Default finds the JDK provider through ServiceLoader
# (META-INF/services/dev.whyoleg.cryptography.CryptographyProviderContainer) and ships no rules.
-keep class dev.whyoleg.cryptography.CryptographyProviderContainer
-keep class * implements dev.whyoleg.cryptography.CryptographyProviderContainer { <init>(); }

# MapLibre: maplibre-native-ffi's rules keep org.bytedeco.javacpp.* but not its presets subpackage, whose `javacpp` preset Loader
# instantiates reflectively for its @Properties ("Could not create an instance of class presets.javacpp" otherwise).
-keep class org.bytedeco.javacpp.presets.** { *; }
